&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PiRwdXFmiomeQDxx0RUuDGJ1sag&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrSYd8kjeoNTrexRDNsuNpZOsMd&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;U8ahdWPg9o80jexsAkFlB1r4gJc&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgzgTcXjjyHmyEgQlsyKb5Cg&quot;&gt;The Workplace IT Specialist ensures a reliable, secure, and high-quality workplace technology experience for employees across our Americas region (including remote US) offices. Based in our New York office, this role is the primary owner of local office IT and workplace facilities, and the first-line point of contact for Americas region user support. The role also provides remote backup and support for other Americas region offices as needed, and works as part of our Global IT team.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgdHNJNqPNklTDyhsUPuVxld&quot;&gt;Second-line support for SaaS platforms and network infrastructure is handled by the broader Global IT team; this role focuses on delivering first-line support and knowing when to escalate. The ideal candidate is customer-focused, technically curious, works well independently, and looks for ways to improve day-to-day IT operations through automation and process improvements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NQ1gdeOLNoEsm2xDroWukiwGs3g&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
