&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxus9qcafz8J9vhi3nwZgrckWg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;CDbadhmlRoKAu0xeQB2lklBvgsS&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgq7kdLI3oOQ1dpeOU3C7XMg&quot;&gt;Our Trading Product Group leads the design of all the products on OKX&#39;s derivatives trading exchange, including spot trading, spot margin, futures, leveraged tokens, trading options etc.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxushHxPgvpIV0pJrijghkWDWe&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;CDbadhmlRoKAu0xeQB2lklBvgsS&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot; old-record-id-R7pFdUvEto2LkuxTv28l3tWmgVq&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Agent Review &amp;amp; Escalation - &lt;/strong&gt;Review AI agent outputs across risk monitoring workflows — assess findings for accuracy, identify false positives, and escalate risk events through the appropriate channels with clear, well-documented rationale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Patrol Operation -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Operate AI-assisted investigation workflows covering key risk metrics. Verify agent reasoning, identify analytical gaps, and ensure the quality output of investigations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Abuse&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Investigation &lt;/strong&gt;- Review AI-surfaced signals related to suspected market abuse, assess the validity, and escalate to the appropriate team with a structured findings report.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SOP Development &amp;amp; Agent Skill Authorship&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;- Translate frontline risk experience into structured SOPs and agent skill sets. Identify blind spots in current detection logic, document edge cases, and collaborate with the Product team to continuously improve automated coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk System Quality Review&lt;/strong&gt; - Conduct regular reviews of agent performance — assessing output quality, surfacing systematic errors, and proposing refinements. Serve as a quality gate between automated risk outputs and business-level decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Risk Coordination&lt;/strong&gt; - Communicate escalated risk findings clearly to Product, Compliance, Legal, and Operations teams. Ensure AI-generated intelligence is accurately interpreted and translated into actionable, well-documented recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot; old-record-id-R7pFdUvEto2LkuxTv28l3tWmgVq&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
